'''Kelly Dean Saalfeld''' (born February 15, 1956) is a former [[Center (American football)|center]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL). Saalfeld was drafted by the [[Green Bay Packers]] in the ninth round of the [[1980 NFL draft]] and would play that season with the [[New York Giants]].
